      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mak ji̱ I-jëp kɛ Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ruëc Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm ku tia̱p kä cɛ buɔ̱m, cuɛ ŋuɔ̱t Kuɔth Nhial pa̱l ruëëc kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ dhieec runi ruëc kua̱r ni Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm. Kɛ ɣöö /ca Kuoth Nhial ŋäth, cu Ci-cɛ̈k kuäär I-jëp Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm mak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ mak kɛ thurbiɛɛli ti bathdɔɔr kɛl wi̱cdɛ kur rɛw, kɛ jiöŋkööri ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛn bäkɛl. Kɛ nɛy ti thil pek ti bä kɛɛl kɛ jɛ kä I-jëp, kɛ ji̱ Lib-ya kɛ ji̱ Thok yuk kɛ ji̱ Kuc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wi̱i̱ Juda tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m a räth nikä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm käp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gök ni Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa ben kä Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm kɛnɛ ruëëc Juda tin ca rɔ dol kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ kui̱ Ci-cɛ̈k, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuoth Nhial ɛ i̱, /‘Cia ɣä lo̱k, kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ca yɛ la̱th tetdä Ci-cɛ̈k.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ kuäär ɛ ŋa̱c i̱ tekɛ kɛ duer, kä cukɛ wee, “Te Kuoth Nhial kɛ cuɔ̱ŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö cikɛ dueriɛn ŋa̱c, cuɛ ruac kɛ Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa i̱, “Kɛ ɣöö cikɛ dueriɛn ŋa̱c, ɣän /cäkɛ bi däk, bäkɛ jak kä kän, /ci kɛ̈cdä bi ben kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ tet Ci-cɛ̈k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi ka kuaany kä jɛ, bikɛ jɛ ku lɛ ŋa̱c mi gɔaa ni ɣöö la̱tkɛ ni ɣä ikä kiɛ la̱tkɛ ni kua̱r ro̱li ti kɔ̱ŋ ikä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ci-cɛ̈k kuäär I-jëp Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm mak, kä cuɛ kuak luaak Kuɔth Nhial kɛnɛ kuak duëël kua̱r ben naŋ. Cuɛ ti diaal naŋ, cuɛ kɛ naŋ amäni köötni dääpä tëë ca täth ɛ Thɔ-lo-mon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm köötni yieethä min yian ta̱th gua̱thnikiɛn, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th tetni bööthni ga̱a̱ŋni tin guɛckɛ thok duëël kua̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ciaŋ mɔ wä kuäär luaak Kuɔth Nhial ɔ, la ga̱a̱ŋ kɛ a kän kä bakɛ nyɔk kɛ loc duëël ga̱a̱ŋni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ɣöö cɛ rɔ lua̱r Kuoth Nhial, /ken Kuoth Nhial ɛ lɛ däk ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ kɛ̈cdɛ. Kä cu ciaŋ gɔaa kä Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ni Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm rɔ yiath piny kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cuɛ jɛ ruac. Kä mëë tookɛ kuäär tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn ŋuaan wi̱cdɛ kɛl, cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run wäl bärɔw, wec ëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ mɛk rɛy thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal i̱ ba jɛ pal thi̱n. Kä cɔalkɛ man i̱ Naamaa kä Am-on. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jiäk la̱t, kɛ ɣöö /kenɛ lɔcdɛ ka̱m Kuoth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cua lät Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm ni tukädɛ cu mäni guutdɛ gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni go̱kä ni Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa kɛnɛ gök ni Ido. Kä la Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm kɛ kɛnɛ Ya-rɔ-baam a nyiëëny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony därwec Dee-bid. Kä cu gatdɛ ni Ä-bi-yaa ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
